  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human Rights Training Project 2017 - 21</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Human Rights Training Project 2017 - 2021 is designed to strengthen the knowledge of human rights ingovernment institutions, academia, media and civil society organizations, while at the same time promoting cooperation between the various actors in Angola. Together, this will contribute to the overall goal of strengthening human rights culture in Angola, thus contributing to increased respect for human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
